## How to use it

Copy this folder to `.claude/skills/{{ sdm.name }}/` in your project (or to `~/.claude/skills/{{ sdm.name }}/`
for every project). The agent reads `SKILL.md`. The other files are for people and tools:

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `SKILL.md` | the instructions the agent follows |
| `schemas/input.schema.json`, `schemas/output.schema.json` | the inputs and outputs as JSON Schema |
| `tests/cases.json` | test cases as data, written from your acceptance criteria |
| `skill.sdm.json` | the skill definition every file here was generated from |
| `spec.json` | the requirement you approved, with your own words as evidence |
| `report.md` | what was checked, and what was not |

